{
  "name": "spring-fest-web",
  "private": true,
  "comments": [
    "The Next.js frontend. Pinned to the 15.2.x line because that is what",
    "Firebase App Hosting's Next.js adapter lists as actively supported —",
    "16.x is outside it. React stays on 18.3: Next 15.2 accepts ^18.2.0, so",
    "every Radix / lucide / motion version carried over from the Vite app",
    "keeps working without a React 19 upgrade riding along."
  ],
  "engines": { "node": ">=20" },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev -p 5173",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start"
  },
  "dependencies": {
